1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,220
When you get your first paycheck, the biggest mistake isn't buying something fun.

2
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:06,000
It's guessing with your health.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,240
We spend money on random supplements and trending diets,

4
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:12,760
while silent risks like insulin resistance, high cholesterol,

5
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:16,500
and vital nutrient deficiencies show zero early symptoms.

6
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:20,580
A comprehensive health check-up replaces guesswork with hard data,

7
00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:24,320
